/**
 * Empty on purpose, and copied to `dist/tsconfig.json` by the
 * `build` script.
 *
 * Bun resolves module specifiers with the nearest `tsconfig.json`.
 * With this empty file beside the compiled output, the
 * `#benchmarks/*` aliases in `dist/` resolve through
 * `package.json#imports` to `dist/` itself, instead of being
 * remapped by the `paths` in the package `tsconfig.json` back to
 * `src/`. That remap would make Bun load TypeScript sources while
 * `node` loads the compiled output, so the two runtimes would not
 * run the same code.
 */
